> integrate exp(x)*sin(x)
∫ exp(x)*sin(x) dx
  = exp(x)*(sin(x) - cos(x))/2 + C
  method: by parts twice (the integral returns)
  check: d/dx of it equals the integrand at 401 points of [-10, 10] (max difference 1.8e-12)
> integrate x*atan(x)
∫ x*atan(x) dx
  = (x^2*atan(x) - x + atan(x))/2 + C
  method: by parts (u = atan(x))
  check: d/dx of it equals the integrand at 401 points of [-10, 10] (max difference 1.8e-15)
> integrate atan(x)
∫ atan(x) dx
  = x*atan(x) - log(x^2 + 1)/2 + C
  method: by parts (u = atan(x))
  check: d/dx of it equals the integrand at 401 points of [-10, 10] (max difference 2.2e-16)
> integrate log(x)^2
∫ log(x)^2 dx
  = x*(log(x)^2 - 2log(x) + 2) + C
  method: by parts (u = log(x)^2)
