> integrate sin(x)^3*cos(x)^2
∫ sin(x)^3*cos(x)^2 dx
  = cos(x)^5/5 - cos(x)^3/3 + C
  method: Bioche: t = cos(x)
  check: d/dx of it equals the integrand at 401 points of [-10, 10] (max difference 1.1e-16)
> integrate sin(x)^2*cos(x)^2
∫ sin(x)^2*cos(x)^2 dx
  = x/8 - sin(4x)/32 + C
  method: power reduction: sin^2 = (1 - cos 2u)/2, cos^2 = (1 + cos 2u)/2
  check: d/dx of it equals the integrand at 401 points of [-10, 10] (max difference 1.4e-16)
> integrate tan(x)^3
∫ tan(x)^3 dx
  = 1/(2cos(x)^2) + log(abs(cos(x))) + C
